Date: Tue, 17 Oct 2023 18:02:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [FEATURE] arm64: dts: realtek: stark: modify the
 rtk_usb_manager

1. move usb power gpio to usb node
2. add usb device mode auto switch

Change-Id: I6d97e9ff84cf60940654e18925b7a648292e7bd8
Signed-off-by: Stanley Chang <stanley_chang@realtek.com>
